    <field name="name">First-time Homebuyer Seminar</field>
    <field name="date_begin">2027-10-18 15:30:00</field>
    <field name="date_end">2027-10-20 15:30:00</field>
    <field name="date_tz">Europe/Brussels</field>
    <field name="description"><![CDATA[<section class="s_text_block o_colored_level">
            <h2>Your path to homeownership starts here</h2><p>Thinking about buying your first home but not sure where to begin?&nbsp;</p><p>This <strong>free seminar</strong> breaks down the entire process into clear, manageable steps — no jargon, no pressure.</p><p>Join us at Country on <strong>18th October from 5PM</strong>&nbsp;as our team of local experts walks you through everything you need to know:</p><ul><li>how much home you can actually afford</li><li>how to get pre-approved for a mortgage</li><li>what down payment assistance programs you may qualify for</li><li>what to expect from offer to closing day</li></ul><p>You'll also hear from a lender and a home inspector who'll answer the questions most buyers don't think to ask.</p><p>Leave with a personalized checklist and the confidence to take your next step. Light refreshments provided.&nbsp;</p><p>Seating is limited</p>
        </section>]]></field>
