    <field name="name">Real estate investor networking night</field>
    <field name="date_begin">2028-03-17 16:30:00</field>
    <field name="date_end">2028-03-17 16:30:00</field>
    <field name="date_tz">Europe/Brussels</field>
    <field name="description"><![CDATA[<section class="s_text_block o_colored_level">
            <h2>Connect. Learn. Build your portfolio</h2>
            <p>Whether you own ten doors or you're eyeing your first rental, this is the room you want to be in. Our Investor Networking Night brings together active investors, agents, lenders, and contractors for an evening of real conversation and real deals.</p><p>Held at <strong>Country</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>March 17th from 5PM</strong>, the night features a short panel on [current market trends / financing strategies / off-market deals], followed by open networking.&nbsp;</p><p>Come to swap strategies, find partners, source your next property, or simply learn from people a few steps ahead of you.</p><p>Drinks and appetizers included.&nbsp;</p><p>Bring plenty of business cards.</p>
        </section>]]></field>
