    <field name="date_tz">Europe/Brussels</field>
    <field name="description"><![CDATA[<section class="s_text_block o_colored_level">
            <h3>Come see Yellow bricks - Open this December 10th</h3><p>Located just outside the city of Namur, Yellow bricks is a unique opportunity to transform a historic Walloon&nbsp;estate into a high-end restaurant and charming guesthouse. Surrounded by nature, cycling trails, and tranquil views, it offers both serenity and strategic access to one of Belgium’s cultural hubs.</p>
            <p>Step inside this 4 bedrooms, 2bathrooms&nbsp;in the heart of Namur&nbsp;and picture yourself home.</p><p>Stop by <strong>December 10th from 5:30PM</strong>&nbsp;— no appointment needed.&nbsp;</p><p>Tour at your own pace, ask us anything, and grab a full property info sheet on your way out.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Priced at&nbsp;824,500$</strong></p><p>Can't make it?&nbsp;Reach out at 06 943 43943 to schedule a private showing.</p>
        </section>
